<view class="page">
  <view class="status-bar" style="height: {{statusBarHeight}}px;"></view>
  <view class="topbar"><view class="back-hit" bindtap="goBack"><text class="back-icon">‹</text></view><text class="topbar-title">皖北菌志</text></view>

  <scroll-view class="scroll" scroll-y>
    <view class="hero">
      <view class="deco-drop"></view>
      <view class="deco-wheat"></view>
      <view class="deco-mushroom"><view class="cap"></view><view class="stem"></view></view>
      <text class="hero-title">皖北水土、气候生态优势</text>
      <text class="hero-subtitle">好水、好气候、好沃土，孕育皖北珍菌</text>
    </view>

    <view class="cards">
      <view class="card">
        <view class="ring ring-1"><text class="ring-num">01</text></view>
        <view class="card-main">
          <text class="card-tag tag-1">01 · 淮水润泽</text>
          <text class="card-title">水质纯净</text>
          <text class="card-desc">地处淮河流域核心水系，地下清冽富硒的天然好水，为菌菇灌溉提供纯净水源。</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="card">
        <view class="ring ring-2"><text class="ring-num">02</text></view>
        <view class="card-main">
          <text class="card-tag tag-2">02 · 气候相宜</text>
          <text class="card-title">温差绝佳</text>
          <text class="card-desc">四季分明，昼夜温差适中，温湿度条件适配菌菇营养与鲜味物质沉淀。</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="card">
        <view class="ring ring-3"><text class="ring-num">03</text></view>
        <view class="card-main">
          <text class="card-tag tag-3">03 · 沃野养份</text>
          <text class="card-title">生态循环</text>
          <text class="card-desc">依托皖北平原农业资源，精选农废秸秆做天然基料，实现绿色生态高品质种植。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="cta" bindtap="goMushroomDetail">
      <text class="cta-text">了解本地菌种  →</text>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
